blurb: The South Portland School Board received the annual State of the Schools presentation,
  detailing student demographics, academic performance, attendance, and behavior trends.
  The meeting also addressed the recent departure of a staff member due to a hateful
  email, reaffirming the district's commitment to diversity and inclusion.
